---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About"
  active="about"
  description="Haotian Fu beyond the lab: distance running."
>
  <section class="pagehead">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Beyond the Lab</h1>
      <p>
        Outside of research, distance running has become another long-term pursuit of mine. 
        Training for races gives me something to work toward, challenges me to push my limits, 
        and reminds me that meaningful progress takes commitment and consistency.
      </p>
      <p>
        Running has also sparked my curiosity about sports science, from training and recovery to nutrition 
        and overall well-being. What started as a hobby has gradually become an important part of how I learn, 
        grow, and take care of myself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="upcoming-races">
    <div class="container measure">
      <h2 class="room-title">Upcoming races</h2>
      <p>
        Here lists multiple races I will participate in the next 6 months.
        <br class="desktop-break" />
        Please reach out to me if you are willing to run with me!!
      </p>
      <ul class="news">
        <li>
          <time datetime="2026-11-22">11/22/2026</time>
          <span>
            <a
              href="https://www.philadelphiamarathon.com/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-link"
            >
              Philadelphia Marathon
            </a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time datetime="2027-03-21">03/21/2027</time>
          <span>
            <a
              href="https://www.nyrr.org/races-and-events/2027/2027-united-airlines-nyc-half"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-link"
            >
              NYRR NYC Half Marathon
            </a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time datetime="2027-04-18">04/18/2027</time>
          <span>
            <a
              href="https://jerseycitymarathon.com/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-link"
            >
              Jersey City Marathon
            </a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <time datetime="2027-04-25">04/25/2027</time>
          <span>
            <a
              href="https://brooklynexperience.com/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-link"
            >
              NYCRuns Brooklyn Experience Half Marathon
            </a>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="past-races">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="room-title">Past Race Results</h2>

      <div class="catalog race-catalog">

        <!-- Race 00: Half Marathon Pacer -->
        <article class="catalog-item race-item">
          <span class="catalog-no">00</span>

          <div class="race-content">
            <div class="race-info">
              <span class="race-meta">First Running Community Service</span>
              <h3>
                <a
                  href="https://runsignup.com/Race/Results/43489/IndividualResult/RJzgK?resultSetId=742863#U103626432"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-link"
                >
                  2026 Suffolk County Half Marathon
                </a>
              </h3>

              <div class="race-time">1:29:08</div>

              <p>
                Official 1:30 pacer today! Great pleasure after helping others sub-1:30!
              </p>
            </div>

            <figure class="race-photo">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/pacer.jpg"
                alt="Steady finish at 1:29:13 gun time"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Race 01: Half Marathon -->
        <article class="catalog-item race-item">
          <span class="catalog-no">01</span>

          <div class="race-content">
            <div class="race-info">
              <span class="race-meta">Most Memorable Half</span>
              <h3>
                <a
                  href="https://results.nyrr.org/runner/8940/result/H2026"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-link"
                >
                  2026 NYRR NYC Half Marathon
                </a>
              </h3>

              <div class="race-time">1:20:35</div>

              <p class="race-ranking">
                Overall 609 / 30240 · Age Group 40 / 707 · Percentage Age-graded 72.46%
              </p>
            </div>

            <figure class="race-photo">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/NYCHalf.jpg"
                alt="A Race Crossing Time Square"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Race 02: Half Marathon -->
        <article class="catalog-item race-item">
          <span class="catalog-no">02</span>

          <div class="race-content">
            <div class="race-info">
              <span class="race-meta">Half Personal Best</span>
              <h3>
                <a
                  href="https://results.nyrr.org/event/26SIHALF/result/4656"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-link"
                >
                  2026 NYRR Staten Island Half Marathon
                </a>
              </h3>

              <div class="race-time">1:18:16</div>

              <p class="race-ranking">
                Overall 116 / 10373 · Age Group 19 / 275 · Percentage Age-graded 74.61%
              </p>
            </div>

            <figure class="race-photo">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/SIHalf.jpeg"
                alt="Half Personal Best"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Race 03: 10K -->
        <article class="catalog-item race-item">
          <span class="catalog-no">03</span>

          <div class="race-content">
            <div class="race-info">
              <span class="race-meta">Most Memorable 10K</span>
              <h3>
                <a
                  href="https://elitefeats.com/res-det/?ID=24605&BibID=1201"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-link"
                >
                  2025 Great Cow Harbor 10K
                </a>
              </h3>

              <div class="race-time">36:00.00</div>

              <p class="race-ranking">
                Overall 71 / 4321 · Age Group 17 / 140 · Percentage Age-graded 73.36%
              </p>
            </div>

            <figure class="race-photo">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/10K.jpg"
                alt="Great Cow Harbor 10K in Northport"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Race 04: 10K -->
        <article class="catalog-item race-item">
          <span class="catalog-no">04</span>

          <div class="race-content">
            <div class="race-info">
              <span class="race-meta">10K Personal Best</span>
              <h3>
                <a
                  href="https://elitefeats.com/res-det/?ID=25378&BibID=1011"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-link"
                >
                  2026 Great Cow Harbor 10K
                </a>
              </h3>

              <div class="race-time">35:30.81</div>

              <p class="race-ranking">
                Overall 55 / 5040 · Age Group 10 / 138 · Percentage Age-graded 74.34%
              </p>
            </div>

            <figure class="race-photo">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/GCH10K.jpg"
                alt="Great Cow Harbor 10K in Northport"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    /* =========================================
      Past Race Results
      ========================================= */

    .race-catalog {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .race-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 36px);
      padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px) 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e1dc;
    }

    .race-item:first-child {
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e1dc;
    }

    .race-item .catalog-no {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #999;
      padding-top: 5px;
    }

    /* Information + photo */
    .race-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 280px);
      gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px);
      align-items: center;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .race-info {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .race-meta {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #888;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .race-info h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.8rem);
      line-height: 1.35;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .race-time {
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .race-ranking {
      font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #777;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Race photos */
    .race-photo {
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 10px;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }

    .race-photo img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    @media (hover: hover) {
      .race-photo:hover img {
        transform: scale(1.03);
      }
    }

    /* =========================================
      Tablet
      ========================================= */

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .race-content {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 200px;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .race-info h3 {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
      }

      .race-time {
        font-size: 2.3rem;
      }
    }

    /* =========================================
      Mobile
      ========================================= */

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .race-item {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 30px 0;
      }

      .race-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 22px;
      }

      .race-meta {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
      }

      .race-info h3 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .race-time {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .race-ranking {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .race-photo {
        max-width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .desktop-break {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>

</Base>
